+/// turboexl3_ds41's `MLX_SERVE_DSV41_ROUTED_ONE`, read here so a bill made before the load sees it: a streamed bank's
+/// prompt call of `rows` rows as one turboexl3 call (`one_plan.callBytes`); 0 with the switch off or no streamed bank.
+fn routedOneBytes(config: anytype, rows: u64) u64 {
+    if (!config.dsv41_streamed) return 0;
+    const mode = one_plan.modeOf(env.span(.MLX_SERVE_DSV41_ROUTED_ONE)) catch return 0;
+    return one_plan.callBytes(mode, rows, config.num_experts_per_tok, config.hidden_size, config.moe_intermediate_size, config.num_experts);
